OL,3,GNEWSACommunity 'heartbroken' after fire
OL,4,Adestroys historic club
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor Mick Spain, this week's suspected
OL,7,Farson attack on the social club he
OL,8,Fmanaged for decades is devastating.
OL,10,F"It is really upsetting for me, I got
OL,11,Fmarried there and we had all our family
OL,12,Ffunctions there. Everyone did and I
OL,13,Ffeel too upset to talk about it," he
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,FCrews responded to a blaze at the
OL,17,Fhistoric Standard Triumph Club, on Tile
OL,18,FHill Lane, Coventry, shortly after
OL,19,F19:55 GMT on Tuesday and the fire
OL,20,Fservice has since confirmed it believes
OL,21,Fthe fire was started deliberately.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
