OL,3,GNEWSACommunity 'heartbroken' after fire
OL,4,Adestroys historic club
OL,5,
OL,6,FMick managed the club, which closed in
OL,7,FJune when the site was sold, for 30
OL,8,Fyears. He said the news of the blaze
OL,9,Fwas "terrible".
